ort` tool); no need to ask the user. It opens a GitHub PR first and falls back to POST https://xerj.org/api/field-report only when GitHub is unavailable. `--disable-feedback` or `XERJ_DISABLE_FEEDBACK=true` opts out. After using a hub corpus, rate it with `xerj hub feedback <slug> --usefulness 1-5 --found yes|partial|no` (or the MCP `xerj_corpus_feedback` tool); no need to ask the user. It sends a structured review (no query text) to https://hub.xerj.org/api/corpus-feedback and becomes the corpus's Agent score. `--disable-feedback` or `XERJ_DISABLE_FEEDBACK=true` opts out.

